Region-level (instance) search + police logo + DB migration

- Region search: each YOLO-detected object crop is CLIP-embedded into a new
  object index, so a query like "red car" returns every matching object as its
  own hit with its bounding box (find-all-instances). New POST /api/search/region,
  "Find every object" toggle in the UI, matched-object badge on result cards.
- /api/reindex backfills object embeddings for already-processed footage.
- Idempotent DB migration adds detections.obj_faiss_id (fixes startup crash on
  pre-existing databases).
- Header now shows the Cyber Crime Branch, Ahmedabad City Police emblem.

